[Cheats/Enable Debug Mode Select toggles debug menu on -  off.Select+Triangle toggles a debug meter.Select+Up - Down toggles debug menu page. L3 pauses - unpauses the game.System Settings Allows toggling of various debug settings. Setting Title Skip  to on will automatically send you to an event select menu.BG, BU Allows viewing of background, character, and event images. This can only be accessed while in a new game or loading a game.Variables Allows changing of various flags.Flag Variables Allows changing of more flags.Scene Select Menu Allows viewing of any scene in the game.]
